{
  "project": {
    "name": "Toothbrush / Razor Holder",
    "slug": "toiletry-holder",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "force_backend": true,
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "description": {
      "en": "A bathroom organizer sized to real handle diameters — manual toothbrushes (~13-16 mm), electric toothbrush bodies (~25-32 mm), and disposable razors (~10-14 mm). Build a counter caddy with a row of upright bores and a drain slot, a wall rail whose keyhole slots grip handles from the side, or a single razor cradle hook.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un organizador de baño dimensionado a diámetros reales de mango — cepillos manuales (~13-16 mm), cuerpos de cepillo eléctrico (~25-32 mm) y rastrillos desechables (~10-14 mm). Genera un soporte de encimera con orificios verticales y ranura de drenaje, un riel de pared cuyas ranuras sujetan mangos por el costado, o un gancho individual para rastrillo.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/toiletry-holder.webp",
    "tags": [
      "bathroom",
